  "note": "Annual election of one third of the Portstewart Urban District Council, January 1924. The Derry Journal reports nominations for four vacancies, with no contest. Browne and Doherty were former candidates; the retiring members D. Reid and J. Tinsley did not seek re-election. Returned unopposed."
